async function academicDocumentServiceSubmit(id){if(!confirm("ยืนยันยื่นคำร้องขอรับบริการเอกสารทางการศึกษา?"))return;const {data,error}=await supabase.rpc("submit_academic_document_service_request",{p_request_id:id});if(error)return toast("ยื่นคำร้องไม่สำเร็จ",error.message,"error");const row=Array.isArray(data)?data[0]:data;if(row)state.academicDocumentServiceRequests=[row,...state.academicDocumentServiceRequests.filter(x=>x.id!==row.id)];toast("ยื่นคำร้องแล้ว","ส่งเข้าสู่ขั้นตอนตรวจอนุมัติ","success");await renderDashboard();}
async function academicDocumentServiceDelete(id){const r=academicDocumentServiceRequestById(id);if(!r||!confirm(`ยืนยันลบคำร้อง ${academicRegThaiDigits(r.request_code||"")} ?`))return;try{const sigs=academicDocumentServiceSignaturesFor(id);for(const sig of sigs)if(sig.storage_path)await supabase.storage.from(sig.bucket||"academic-registration").remove([sig.storage_path]);const {error}=await supabase.from("academic_document_service_requests").delete().eq("id",id);if(error)throw error;state.academicDocumentServiceRequests=state.academicDocumentServiceRequests.filter(x=>x.id!==id);state.academicDocumentServiceSignatures=state.academicDocumentServiceSignatures.filter(x=>x.request_id!==id);state.selectedAcademicDocumentServiceId=null;toast("ลบคำร้องแล้ว","ระบบจัดลำดับเลขคำร้องที่เหลือใหม่แล้ว","success");await loadAcademicRegistrationWorkspace();await renderDashboard();}catch(err){toast("ลบคำร้องไม่สำเร็จ",err.message||String(err),"error");}}
async function academicDocumentServiceReviewModal(id,slot){
  const r=academicDocumentServiceRequestById(id);if(!r||!academicDocumentServiceCanReviewSlotUi(slot,r))return;const sig=academicDocumentServiceSignatureFor(id,slot),decision=r[`${slot}_decision`]||"pending",reason=r[`${slot}_reason`]||"";
  const m=document.createElement("div");m.className="modal-backdrop";m.innerHTML=`<div class="modal"><div class="modal-head"><div><h3>${escapeHtml(academicDocumentServiceSlotLabel(slot))}</h3><p>บันทึกความเห็นและลายเซ็น</p></div><button class="modal-close">×</button></div><div class="form-grid"><div class="field"><label>ความเห็น</label><select class="select" name="decision"><option value="pending" ${decision==="pending"?"selected":""}>รอตรวจ</option><option value="approve" ${decision==="approve"?"selected":""}>เห็นควรอนุมัติ</option><option value="reject" ${decision==="reject"?"selected":""}>ไม่ควรอนุมัติ</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>เหตุผล / หมายเหตุ</label><input class="input" name="reason" value="${escapeHtml(reason)}"></div><div class="academic-transfer-sign-choice"><strong>วิธีลงลายเซ็น</strong><div class="signature-mode-grid"><button type="button" class="signature-mode-option" data-ds-sign="paper"><strong>เซ็นสดบนกระดาษ</strong><span>เว้นช่องใน PDF</span></button><button type="button" class="signature-mode-option" data-ds-sign="drawn"><strong>เซ็นสดในระบบ</strong><span>เมาส์ / นิ้ว / ปากกา</span></button><button type="button" class="signature-mode-option" data-ds-sign="upload"><strong>อัปโหลดรูปลายเซ็น</strong><span>PNG / JPG / WebP</span></button></div><div class="academic-transfer-current-sign">ปัจจุบัน: <strong>${academicTransferSignatureMethodLabel(sig?.method)}</strong></div><div id="document-service-sign-work"></div></div></div><div class="modal-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost modal-cancel">ปิด</button></div></div>`;
  document.body.appendChild(m);const close=()=>m.remove(),work=m.querySelector("#document-service-sign-work");m.querySelector(".modal-close").onclick=close;m.querySelector(".modal-cancel").onclick=close;
  const save=async(method,blob=null,mime=null,btn=null)=>{if(btn)buttonLoading(btn,true,"กำลังบันทึก...");let path=null;try{const rv=await supabase.rpc("set_academic_document_service_review",{p_request_id:id,p_slot:slot,p_decision:m.querySelector('[name="decision"]').value,p_reason:m.querySelector('[name="reason"]').value||null});if(rv.error)throw rv.error;if(blob){const ext=mime==="image/png"?"png":mime==="image/webp"?"webp":"jpg";path=`document-service-signatures/${id}/${slot}/${crypto.randomUUID()}.${ext}`;const up=await supabase.storage.from("academic-registration").upload(path,blob,{contentType:mime,upsert:false});if(up.error)throw up.error;}const sg=await supabase.rpc("set_academic_document_service_signature",{p_request_id:id,p_slot:slot,p_method:method,p_storage_path:path});if(sg.error)throw sg.error;if(sig?.storage_path&&sig.storage_path!==path)await supabase.storage.from(sig.bucket||"academic-registration").remove([sig.storage_path]);close();toast("บันทึกส่วนตรวจแล้ว",academicDocumentServiceSlotLabel(slot),"success");await loadAcademicRegistrationWorkspace();await renderDashboard();}catch(err){if(path)await supabase.storage.from("academic-registration").remove([path]);toast("บันทึกไม่สำเร็จ",err.message||String(err),"error");}finally{if(btn)buttonLoading(btn,false);}};
  m.querySelectorAll("[data-ds-sign]").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{const method=b.dataset.dsSign;if(method==="paper"){work.innerHTML=`<button class="btn btn-primary" id="ds-paper">บันทึกความเห็นและเลือกเซ็นบนกระดาษ</button>`;work.querySelector("#ds-paper").onclick=e=>save("paper",null,null,e.target);}else if(method==="drawn"){work.innerHTML=`<div class="signature-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="signature-canvas" width="900" height="300"></canvas></div><div class="signature-canvas-actions"><button class="btn btn-ghost" id="signature-clear">ล้าง</button><button class="btn btn-primary" id="ds-drawn">บันทึก</button></div>`;setupSignatureCanvas(m);work.querySelector("#ds-drawn").onclick=async e=>{if(!m._signatureHasInk?.())return toast("ยังไม่มีลายเซ็น","","error");await save("drawn",await canvasBlob(work.querySelector("#signature-canvas")),"image/png",e.target);};}else{work.innerHTML=`<div class="field"><label>เลือกรูปลายเซ็น</label><input class="input" id="ds-sign-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></div><button class="btn btn-primary" id="ds-upload">บันทึก</button>`;work.querySelector("#ds-upload").onclick=async e=>{const f=work.querySelector("#ds-sign-file").files[0];if(!f)return toast("กรุณาเลือกไฟล์ลายเซ็น","","error");await save("upload",f,f.type,e.target);};}});
}
