function officialAttendanceClockKey(value){const m=String(value||"").match(/^(\d{1,2}):(\d{2})(?::(\d{2}))?/);return m?`${String(m[1]).padStart(2,"0")}:${m[2]}:${m[3]||"00"}`:"23:59:59";}
function officialAttendanceThaiDate(value){return value?thaiDateCompact(value):"—";}
function officialAttendanceAcademicYearForDate(value){const d=officialAttendanceDateObj(value);if(!d)return currentAcademicPeriod().academicYear;const s=officialAttendanceDateValue(d);const term=(state.academicTerms||[]).find(t=>t.start_date&&t.end_date&&s>=String(t.start_date)&&s<=String(t.end_date));if(term)return Number(term.academic_year);return d.getMonth()+1>=5?d.getFullYear()+543:d.getFullYear()+542;}
function officialAttendanceRangeForYear(academicYear=state.officialAttendanceReportAcademicYear||currentAcademicPeriod().academicYear){const y=Number(academicYear),terms=(state.academicTerms||[]).filter(t=>Number(t.academic_year)===y&&t.start_date&&t.end_date);if(terms.length)return {start:terms.map(t=>String(t.start_date)).sort()[0],end:terms.map(t=>String(t.end_date)).sort().slice(-1)[0]};const g=y-543;return {start:`${g}-05-01`,end:`${g+1}-04-30`};}
